# files/ is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT — this repo is public (www.yizhoujin.com).
# Everything under files/ is ignored unless re-included below, so a new or
# RENAMED working directory can never silently become publishable.
# Adding a genuinely public asset dir? Add a `!` line for it here.
